		Section lihc1_media_mode
			when-movable-cycle-day-is
				78 use:
					Media rid ocVE.MM.LIHC1.text @mode M1 @day D1 End-Media
				95 use:
					Media rid ocVE.MM.LIHC1.text @mode M4 @day D1 End-Media
				110 use:
					Media rid ocVE.MM.LIHC1.text @mode M6 @day D1 End-Media
				120 use:
					Media rid ocVE.MM.LIHC1.text @mode M1 @day D1 End-Media
				otherwise use:
