	Section aposglory_church_feast
		Insert_section TI.g.local_church End-Insert
		when-movable-cycle-day-is
			95 use:
				Title role smallcenter sid ti.ForMidpentecost End-Title
				Insert_section VE._08_Aposticha__.glory__.pe__.gloryasglory_.hymn End-Insert
			110 use:
				Title role smallcenter sid ti.ForAscension End-Title
				Insert_section VE._08_Aposticha__.glory__.pe__.gloryasglory_.hymn End-Insert
			120 use:
				Title role smallcenter sid ti.ForPentecost End-Title
				Insert_section VE._08_Aposticha__.glory__.pe__.gloryasglory_.hymn End-Insert
			otherwise use:
				when-date-is
